# DocMind Environment Variables
#
# The backend currently runs fully offline (local embeddings + local Ollama
# LLM) and does not read any environment variables at runtime.
#
# This file is kept as a placeholder for future configuration, e.g. if you
# swap the local Ollama call in main.py's step6_generate() for a hosted LLM
# API. Copy this file to .env and add any keys you introduce there —
# .env is git-ignored so real secrets never get committed.
